# Build context for the Dockerfile: it copies only package*.json, tsconfig*.json, src/ and
# examples/. Everything else stays out of the context, so local keys, node_modules and
# run transcripts are never sent to the Docker daemon or a remote builder.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
dist-staging
coverage
*.tgz
**/runs
temp
reports
docs
board
tests
bench
site
etc
